def quantumProcessingIdeas_statement48 : String := "Content registration is for members. They register and update bibliographic and non-bibliographic metadata. The metadata is preserved.\nidea: Contributors are registered with the content.\nidea: Funding is registered with the content.\nidea: Publication history is registered with the content.\nidea: Peer review is registered with the content.\nidea: Access indicators are registered with the content.\nidea: Related research artefacts are registered with the content."
